They _are_ REALLY nasty - I've been trashed by one twice:
2    3391384  ngm-E died in the endgame [max 53].               - [357]
                Killed by invisible Archon.
3    2937902  ngm-V died
                in The Dungeons of Doom on level 25 [max 49].   - [389]
                Killed by an invisible Archon.
That was after 2 amulets of lifesaving, and both characters had better
than -30 AC. It didn't help that they were hitting me at least 8 times to
my once, even though I had the 'very fast' intrinsic. They also seem to be
able to summon many other nasties which meant in both cases that I wasn't
able to run away :-(
IMHO, the Archon is just about the only monster that _can_ take out a
character that is good enough to beat the wiz. So if you get one as a pet,
make sure you don't leave him on a level you'll be coming back to any
time...

